# 🧠 END-TO-END ENGINEERING BLUEPRINT
## Client Portal System — Skill Wanderer

---

## 0. OBJECTIVE

This document defines a **deterministic engineering blueprint** to transform the current system into a **production-grade distributed architecture**.

Scope includes:

- Keycloak integration (client realm)
- Frontend refactor (Next.js)
- Backend creation (Laravel)
- Infrastructure routing (Cloudflare)
- End-to-end deployment
- Final system state (target snapshot)

